  "aiOverview": {
    "content": "T-Mobile Center is a premier 20,000-seat multi-purpose arena in downtown Kansas City, Missouri (1407 Grand Blvd), located in the Power & Light District. It hosts major concerts—including Cardi B in March 2026—sports, and family events, featuring fully cashless, modern amenities. The venue serves as a major hub for entertainment and private events. Key Information for Visitors (2026): Location: 1407 Grand Blvd, Kansas City, MO 64106. Bag Policy: No clear bag policy, but bags cannot exceed 12x6x12 inches. Backpacks and chain wallets are prohibited. Cashless Venue: Only credit, debit, or mobile payments are accepted for parking, tickets, concessions, and merchandise. T-Mobile Perks: Customers can access the T-Mobile fast-track entry with their Magenta Pass in the T LIFE app. Parking/Transportation: Located in the Power & Light District, surrounded by various parking garages. Upcoming Events (Spring 2026): Bad Omens: Feb 26, 2026 Cardi B: March 17, 2026 Bring Me The Horizon: May 12, 2026 Amenities: The College Basketball Experience: A fan-interactive attraction located inside the venue. Konica Minolta Founders Club: Available for private events and premium experiences.",
